content.text:
Since `PremiumModel` is a one-to-one relation on `Guild`, use a nested `update`:

```ts
await prisma.guild.update({
  where: { guildId: "your-guild-id" },
  data: {
    premium: {
      update: {
        active: true,
        expiry: "2026-10-25",
      },
    },
  },
})
```

If a `PremiumModel` might not exist yet for that guild, use `upsert` instead of `update` inside `premium`.

Source: `apps/docs/content/docs/orm/v7/reference/prisma-client-reference.mdx` — "Nested update example" (One-to-one relations), lines 5206-5217.

